### Page 1 of 2

```text
MEMO

TO:

Honorable Mayor Patrick J. Collins, City of Cheyenne
Members of the City Council, City of Cheyenne

FROM:
Doug Klahn, Construction Manager

DATE:
November 15, 2023

SUBJECT:
Contract Modification #1 to Zand Z Asphalt for the 2023 Crack Seal #1 project.

Please find the attached proposed contract modification for the above referenced city project.
Construction and Engineering Staff have discussed the additional material required to complete
this project and determined that the additional cost associated with the supply and installation of
this material is in accordance with the original contract unit pricing. Additionally, this contract
modification is beneficial to the city as it requires no additional mobilization costs and ensures the
maximum number of lane miles are being treated with this contract. The additional cost associated
with this work is estimated at $100,667.16. The project is carrying an approximate balance of
unused funds in the amount of $10,000 therefore, the requested amount for this modification is
$90,667.16. In addition, this will require an extension of the completion date to December 31,
2023. Staff respectfully request your approval of this contract modification.

CITY ENGINEER’S OFFICE
2101 O’Neil Avenue
Cheyenne, Wyoming 82001
```

