CITY OF CHEYENNE
CONTRACT MODIFICATION

Contract Modification:#1
Project: 2023 Crack Seal #1
Project Number:  Contract # 7770
Contractor:  Z and Z Asphalt
Date Prepared:  November 15, 2023

The above referenced contract is amended or modified as set forth in the following and these
amendments and modifications of the plans and specifications are agreed to by the parties. All other
aspects of the original agreement remain unchanged and in full force and effect.

I. Description of Changes
An additional fifty thousand eight hundred forty-two (50,842) pounds of supplied and installed
crack seal was needed due to the excessive size of several cracks throughout various locations
within the project.

II. New Contract Items
Not Applicable.

III. Schedule
The contract completion date will be adjusted to December 31, 2023.

